 patients in hospitals is only one-fourth that of the number
 of city Y residents who are patients in hospitals.$pilot$, $pilot$Each of the following, if true, contributes to an
 explanation of the difference in the number of residents
 who are patients in hospitals except:$pilot$, $pilot$D$pilot$, true, $pilot$Pilot approved 2026-09-28; question text from local bank snapshot.$pilot$ FROM lr_sections s WHERE s.preptest=156 AND s.section=4 AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM lr_questions q WHERE q.qid=$pilot$PT156-S4-Q10$pilot$) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO lr_answer_choices (question_id, letter, choice_text, tag, is_correct) SELECT q.id, $pilot$A$pilot$, $pilot$Preventive health programs are more prevalent in city X than in city Y.$pilot$, $pilot$Helps Explain$pilot$, false FROM lr_questions q WHERE q.qid=$pilot$PT156-S4-Q10$pilot$ AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM lr_answer_choices c WHERE c.question_id=q.id AND c.letter=$pilot$A$pilot$) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO lr_answer_choices (question_id, letter, choice_text, tag, is_correct) SELECT q.id, $pilot$B$pilot$, $pilot$The hospitals in city X are noted as leaders in employing outpatient treatment wherever possible.$pilot$, $pilot$Helps Explain$pilot$, false FROM lr_questions q WHERE q.qid=$pilot$PT156-S4-Q10$pilot$ AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM lr_answer_choices c WHERE c.question_id=q.id AND c.letter=$pilot$B$pilot$) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO lr_answer_choices (question_id, letter, choice_text, tag, is_correct) SELECT q.id, $pilot$C$pilot$, $pilot$The drinking water of city Y has dangerously high levels of pollutants, whereas this is not the case for city X.$pilot$, $pilot$Helps Explain$pilot$, false FROM lr_questions q WHERE q.qid=$pilot$PT156-S4-Q10$pilot$ AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM lr_answer_choices c WHERE c.question_id=q.id AND c.letter=$pilot$C$pilot$) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO lr_answer_choices (question_id, letter, choice_text, tag, is_correct) SELECT q.id, $pilot$D$pilot$, $pilot$The hospitals in city Y are of very high quality, and residents of city X are often sent there for treatment.$pilot$, $pilot$Correct$pilot$, true FROM lr_questions q WHERE q.qid=$pilot$PT156-S4-Q10$pilot$ AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM lr_answer_choices c WHERE c.question_id=q.id AND c.letter=$pilot$D$pilot$) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
